    "body": "After https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36294:\n\n* The MiniWallet mode can be dropped (using the default), now that all nodes support taproot.\n* The `sync_fun=self.no_op` can be dropped (using the default sync), if the node connection is done earlier.\n* A check for the unbroadcast set can be added, now that all nodes support persisting the set.",
